      "reply_permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@saars.foto/post/DfKyC7cmIUv",
      "text": "Getting that close without spooking it is the whole trick - you kept the wing pattern tack sharp and let the green stem lead the eye straight to it. Did it sit still for you, or did you have to wait it out?",
