      "reply_permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@saars.foto/post/DfKyBjSmTk2",
      "text": "You let that one golden tree carry the whole frame against the blue mist - the dark trunks in front frame it like a stage. Did you walk the woods looking for that one lit tree, or did the fog part around it while you were shooting?",
