      "reply_permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@saars.foto/post/DfKyAVbmMjJ",
      "text": "You caught the mist sitting in a perfect band between the hills and the trees, and then the loch doubled the whole thing - that reflection is so clean it reads like a second sky. Early start to catch the mist that low, or did it hang around for you?",
